# A dead bar after an ability picker answered with nothing to follow (prod
# matches m-3bc0ad1f5ac1 and m-d87aabc2c3e2, 2026-10-11). Both seats hold
# Ghost Quarter, whose click offers two abilities ({T}: Add {C}; {T},
# Sacrifice: destroy target land), so a click opens the picker. Its "None"
# leaves Forge in the same priority input, and Forge sends nothing at all.
# Seat 0 (human) can also cast Storm Crow ({1}{U}) off two Islands, putting a
# spell on the stack for seat 1 to hold priority over.
